<title>GERMANY: Benetton looking for German publishing partner.</title>
<headline>Benetton looking for German publishing partner.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian fashion group Benetton is looking for a German publisher for its in-house-produced magazine Colors, marketing newsletter New Business reported on Monday.</p>
<p>Benetton creative director Oliviero Toscani told New Business he hoped to finding a German publishing house which would serve as a partner of the magazine, but said Colors would continue to be designed by the company.</p>
<p>Toscani also reiterated that Benetton will continue to plan and realise its own campaigns, New Business reported.</p>
</text>
